SUMMARY:🍀🍽️ Pints & Pub Grub Before Nick’s Karaoke Bash! 🎂
 🎤
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 15 Years!\n# 🍀
 🍽️ Dinner at Michael Collins Irish Pub! 🎂🎤\n\n**Come for the fo
 od. Stay for the conversation. Then let’s celebrate Nick’s birthday wi
 th karaoke!**\n\nBefore we head to Nick’s birthday karaoke party\, let
 ’s get together for dinner at **Michael Collins Irish Pub**\, a welcomin
 g Irish pub on Bloor Street West near Ossington.\n\nIt’s a chance to enj
 oy a good meal\, catch up with familiar faces\, meet some new people\, and
  get the birthday celebrations started before the music begins!\nWhether y
 ou’re joining us because you love Irish pub food\, want to socialize\, o
 r are coming along for the full birthday evening\, you’re welcome at the
  table. 🍀\n\n## 🍽️ Michael Collins Irish Pub\n\nMichael Collins is
  an Irish-style pub serving a menu of pub favourites\, with options such a
 s fish and chips\, burgers\, shepherd’s pie\, and other hearty dishes.\n
 It’s a relaxed setting to enjoy dinner and conversation before we head o
 ver to the karaoke party.\n📍 **Location:** Michael Collins Irish Pub\n*
 *926 Bloor Street West\, Toronto**\n\n🌐 **Website & Menu:** [Visit Mich
 ael Collins Irish Pub](https://michaelcollinspub.ca/)\nPlease check the me
 nu and current prices before attending. Everyone pays for their own food a
 nd drinks.\n\n## 🕕 Meetup Details\n\n📅 **Saturday\, November 28\, 20
 26**\n🕕 **Meetup time:** 6:15 PM\n📍 **Meeting spot:** Outside Michae
 l Collins Irish Pub. Look for my Moose Hat! 🦌\nWe’ll have approximate
 ly 90 minutes for dinner and socializing before heading to Nick’s birthd
 ay karaoke party.\n\nAround **8:00–8:15 PM**\, we’ll leave the pub and
  walk over to the Owl’s Club\, aiming to arrive in time for the **8:30 P
 M** birthday gathering.\nPlease arrive on time so we can make the most of 
 our dinner together.\n\n## 🎤 After Dinner: Nick’s Birthday Karaoke Ba
 sh!\n\nAfter dinner\, we’ll head to the **Owl’s Club (BRING CASH)**\, 
 where Nick will be celebrating his birthday with karaoke\, drinks\, and pl
 enty of opportunities to socialize.\nYou can sing\, cheer on the performer
 s\, or sit back and enjoy the show. You don’t have to be a karaoke super
 star to join the fun!\n\n🎤 **Owl’s Club**\n\n847 Dovercourt Road\, To
 ronto\nRemember that the Owl’s Club is **cash only**.\n\n## 💵 Save Yo
 ur Spot — Please Read Before RSVPing\n\nBecause this is a restaurant out
 ing\, I’m using a reservation fee to make sure people who sign up are co
 mmitted to attending.\n**A $25 e-transfer must be sent to [mathewmaclean@h
 otmail.com](mailto:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com) within 24 hours of signing u
 p.**\n\nHere’s how it works:\n\n* **$25** is required to secure your spo
 t.\n* **$20 will be returned to you when you show up.**\n* **$5 is the Mee
 tup fee** that supports the group.\n* If payment is not received within 24
  hours\, your spot may be given to someone else.\n* **There are no refunds
  for any reason.**\n\nThis policy applies to everyone\, regardless of how 
 long you’ve been a member. Please don’t RSVP unless you’re committed
  to attending dinner.\n**Waiting list:** If the event is full and you’re
  placed on the waiting list\, please do not send payment unless I contact 
 you and confirm that a spot has become available.\n\n## 🌈 Who Is This F
 or?\n\nThis group is for people who want to be social\, make friends\, and
  enjoy time together — whether single or partnered.\nWe organize movies\
 , walks\, hikes\, restaurant outings\, arts and culture events\, karaoke\,
  and plenty more.\n\nYou’re welcome to join us for dinner and continue t
 o the karaoke party afterward. It’s a great way to turn a birthday celeb
 ration into a full evening of food\, conversation\, music\, and new connec
 tions.\n\n## ⚠️ Important Notes\n\n* Please direct questions to me thr
 ough the Meetup event wall or by email rather than contacting the restaura
 nt.\n* Keep an eye on the event page for any updates or changes.\n* Everyo
 ne pays for their own meal and drinks.\n* The karaoke venue is cash only.\
 n\n👤 **Organized by Mathew.**\nQuestions? Post on the event wall or ema
 il **[torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mailto:torontomoviesandoutings@
 hotmail.com)**.\n\n🍀 **Come for the food.**\n🎂 **Stay for the birthd
 ay celebration.**\n🎤 **Make some new friends along the way!**
