SUMMARY:Free event. Bello's Birthday Bash w/karaoke @ Owl's Club
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 15 Years!\n# 🎂
 🎤 Nick's Birthday Karaoke Bash! 🎤🎂\n\n### Saturday\, November 28\
 n\nIt is my birthday week\, so of course I'm looking to celebrate the best
  way I know how — **with good friends\, great music\, and karaoke!** 
 🥳🎶\n\nCome out and help me celebrate at one of Toronto's most unique
  karaoke spots — the **legendary Owl's Club!**\n\n**IMPORTANT - cash onl
 y at this venue.**\n\n📍 **Owl's Club**\n**847 Dovercourt Road\, Toronto
 **\n\nLocated just a short walk from **Ossington Subway Station**\, the Ow
 l's Club is a unique venue with a rich and colourful history. It's also be
 come legendary for its **Saturday karaoke nights**\, making it the perfect
  place for a birthday celebration.\n\n### 🎤 KARAOKE!\n\nAs always\, **y
 ou can sing or just sit back\, relax and enjoy the performances.** Whether
  you're a seasoned karaoke superstar or someone who prefers being part of 
 the audience\, everyone is welcome!\nKaraoke usually gets underway around 
 **9:15–9:30 PM** and it can get VERY busy\, so if you want to sing\, **p
 ut your songs in early!** 🎶\n\n### 🎱 More than karaoke!\n\nThere are
  plenty of other things to do while you're waiting for your turn at the mi
 crophone:\n🎯 **Free darts**\n🎱 **Pool table**\n🏒 **Shuffleboard**
 \n🍻 Drinks & socializing\n🎤 And\, of course\, lots of karaoke!\n\n##
 # ⏰ When to arrive\n\n**8:30 PM onward**\nNick will be there from around
  8:30 PM. Come early\, grab a drink\, get comfortable and socialize before
  the karaoke gets rolling.\n**Leaving time:** Whenever you like! Stay for 
 one song or stay until the last singer — totally up to you.\n\n### 🥳 
 COME HELP ME CELEBRATE!\n\nBirthdays are better with friends\, so I'd love
  to see some familiar faces and meet some new ones too!\nThis isn't just a
 bout karaoke — it's about **getting together\, meeting people\, having s
 ome laughs and enjoying a fun Saturday night in Toronto.**\nSingle\, partn
 ered\, married\, new to the group or a longtime member — **everyone is w
 elcome!**\n\n### 📱 Want to hear about more events?\n\nJoin our **WhatsA
 pp group** to stay connected and learn about upcoming events.\n\n**THIS GR
 OUP IS FOR PEOPLE WHO WANT TO BE SOCIAL AND MAKE FRIENDS — WHETHER YOU'R
 E SINGLE OR NOT SINGLE.**\n\nWe also organize lots of other events\, inclu
 ding:\n🎬 Movies\n🚶 Walks\n🥾 Hikes\n🎨 Arts & Culture\n🍽️ R
 estaurants\n🎤 Trivia\n🎉 And plenty more!\n\n### 👍 Not sure if you
  can make it?\n\n**You can just show up!**\nIf you're not 100% sure about 
 your schedule\, don't feel like you have to RSVP and then cancel later. Yo
 u can simply **show up on the day if you end up being free.**\n\n### 📧 
 Stay in the loop\n\nDon't forget to join our email list! Meetup does not s
 end emails to everyone in the group\, so this is the best way to get our w
 eekly news and hear about upcoming events:\n[http://eepurl.com/hKt76f](htt
 p://eepurl.com/hKt76f)\n\n### 👋 Your Organizer\n\n**Nick** is the organ
 izer for this Meetup.\nIf you need to contact him\, please post a message 
 on the Meetup wall\n\n🎂 **Come celebrate my birthday\, grab the mic (or
  don't!)\, and let's make it a great night!** 🎤🥳
