SUMMARY:🍁 Fall Walk: Scarborough Bluffs & Guildwood Gardens Adventure! 
 🌾🏞️
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 15 Years!\n## 🍁
  **Fall Walk: Scarborough Bluffs & Guildwood Gardens Adventure!** 🌾🏞
 ️\n\nJoin us for a **gorgeous fall walk** as we explore the golden leave
 s\, crisp air\, and stunning views of **Guildwood Gardens** and the **Scar
 borough Bluffs**!\nWe’ll start our adventure at **Guildwood Gardens**\, 
 a peaceful and historic park that transforms beautifully in autumn. Once h
 ome to Toronto’s creative elite\, this garden is filled with sculptures\
 , architectural relics\, and winding pathways framed by fiery fall foliage
 . It’s like stepping into a living art gallery — only with more squirr
 els and crunchy leaves. 🍂🎨\nFrom there\, we’ll make our way to the
  **Scarborough Bluffs**\, one of the city’s most breathtaking natural wo
 nders.\n\nThe bluffs stretch for 15 km along Lake Ontario\, and in the fal
 l\, the contrast between the turquoise water and the amber trees is *chef
 ’s kiss*. We’ll walk the scenic waterfront trail\, breathe in the fres
 h air\, and enjoy some of the best autumn views Toronto has to offer. 🍁
 🌊\n\nThis is one of our most **photogenic fall walks** — so bring you
 r camera (and your cozy flannel)!\n\n***\n\n### 📍 **Meetup Details**\n\
 n**Meeting Spot:** Inside **Kennedy Station** by *Gateway on the Go* (on t
 he Bus Platform).\nLook for me wearing my **famous Moose Hat!** 🦌\n**
 🕚 Meetup Time:** **10:15 A.M. sharp!**\nI’ll wait about 5 minutes —
  *Early is on time. On time is late!*\n\n**🚌 Bus:** We’ll take the **
 116 Morningside Bus** to Guild Park & Gardens.\nThe bus leaves at **10:30 
 A.M.** — don’t miss it\, or you’ll have to catch up on your own!\n\n
 **🚗 Driving:**\nFree parking is available at the **Guild Inn Estate**.\
 nWe’ll meet drivers around **11:00 A.M.** near the bus stop in front of 
 the Guild Inn by the road.\nPlease let me know if you’re driving — not
 e that you’ll have to walk a little to get back to your car after the hi
 ke.\n\n***\n\n### 💲 **Meetup Fee**\n\n$5 (cash 💵 or e-transfer 📲 
 to **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**)\nYou can send it before or on the day of
  the event!\n\n***\n\n### 🥾 **What to Bring**\n\n* Water 💧\n* Good w
 alking/hiking shoes 👟\n* A snack or light lunch 🍎\n* A cozy sweater 
 or jacket — it *will* be breezy by the lake! 🧣\n* Camera or phone for
  those perfect fall photos 🍁📸\n\n***\n\n### ⚠️ **A Quick Note**\
 n\nSometimes life happens and I might need to cancel or reschedule — ple
 ase keep an eye on the event page for updates.\n\n***\n\n### 👋 **About 
 This Group**\n\nThis group is open to **everyone** — whether you’re si
 ngle\, social\, new to the city\, or just want to get out and enjoy the fa
 ll colours!\nWe also host **movies\, hikes\, arts & culture events\, and r
 estaurant outings.**\n\nYou can RSVP in advance — or just show up if you
 ’re feeling spontaneous!\n\n***\n\n**Organizer:** Mathew\n📧 **toronto
 moviesandoutings@hotmail.com**\n\n**Come for the water.** 🐦 **Stay for 
 the view.**\n**Leave with a new connection — and maybe a new friend.** 
 🍂💛
