 //www.scene.ca](https://www.scene.ca)\n\n***\n\n### 🎥 **A Quick Word Ab
 out Movie Etiquette**\n\nWe love a great film experience. Please:\n\n* Tur
 n off your phone\n* Don’t talk during the movie\n* Be respectful of othe
 rs\n\nRepeat offenders will be removed from the group — we take our cine
 ma seriously (but with snacks).\n\n***\n\n### 👥 **About the Group**\n\n
 This event is open to everyone — single\, not single\, shy\, social\, ne
