SUMMARY:🌸✨ Fleurs de Villes  JOYEUX: The Must-See Holiday Floral Trai
 l! ✨🌸
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 15 Years!\n# 🎁 
 Toronto’s Most Instagrammable Holiday Walk Returns!\n\n🌸✨ **Fleurs 
 de Villes JOYEUX – A Holiday Floral Trail!** ✨🌸\n\nCome out and enj
 oy a beautiful Thursday evening in Bloor–Yorkville! **Fleurs de Villes J
 OYEUX** transforms the neighbourhood into an open-air gallery filled with 
 fresh flowers and spectacular festive floral creations.\n\nDiscover more t
 han 30 unique installations\, handcrafted by talented Toronto florists usi
 ng fresh blooms. From life-sized floral sculptures to whimsical holiday de
 signs\, these creations are a feast for the eyes and make for some wonderf
 ul photo opportunities. 📸\n\nGrab your camera\, bundle up\, and join us
  for an evening stroll through one of Toronto's most beautiful neighbourho
 ods. It's a chance to enjoy the flowers\, take in the holiday atmosphere\,
  and spend a little time together!\n\n***\n\n## 🌹 Meetup Details\n\n
 📍 **Meeting Location:** Outside the Toronto Reference Library (Bloor & 
 Yonge)\n👒 Look for Mathew wearing his famous Moose Hat!\n🕡 **Meeting
  Time:** 6:30 PM sharp\nMathew will wait a maximum of 5 minutes before the
  group departs.\n🏁 **End Point:** Yonge & Bloor\n💲 **Group Support F
 ee: $5 IN CASH or E-transfer**\n📲 **E-transfer:** [mathewmaclean@hotmai
 l.com](mailto:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)\n\nThe fee applies to everyone\, 
 regardless of how long you've been a member. There are no exceptions or re
 funds. Your contribution helps support the group and keep our activities g
 oing. Thank you!\n\n***\n\n## 👟 What to Bring\n\n* Comfortable walking 
 shoes 👣\n* Water 💧\n* Your phone or camera for photos 📸\n* Weathe
 r-appropriate clothing 🧣\n\nRemember\, there's no such thing as bad wea
 ther\, only bad clothing!\n\n***\n\n## 🥂 Come for the Flowers\, Stay fo
 r the Christmas Cheer!\n\nAfter exploring Toronto's beautiful holiday flor
 al trail\, we'll head over to **Jack Astor's**\, which gets into the Chris
 tmas spirit with its festive holiday bar decorations! 🎄🍹\nCome for t
 he flowers\, stay for the Christmas atmosphere\, good food\, drinks\, and 
 great company!\n\nWe'll finish the evening together with a little holiday 
 cheer. Participation after the walk is optional\, and members are responsi
 ble for their own food and drinks.\n\n⚠️ **Event Updates:** Occasional
 ly\, circumstances may require an event to be rescheduled or changed. Plea
 se check the event page for updates before heading out.\n\n***\n\n**Organi
 zer:** Mathew\nQuestions? Post on the event wall or email [torontomoviesan
 doutings@hotmail.com](mailto:torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com)
