SUMMARY:🎄🚋 Christmas on the Rails — Vintage Streetcars & Chuck’s
  Roadhouse Road Trip!
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 15 Years!\n🎄
 🚋 Christmas on the Rails — Vintage Streetcars & Chuck’s Roadhouse R
 oad Trip!\n\nSaturday\\\, December 5\\\, 2026 \\| Depart Toronto at 11:30 
 AM\n\nReady for a festive trip back in time? Join us for a unique Christma
 s adventure at the Halton County Radial Railway Museum in Milton!\n\n[http
 s://hcry.org/christmas-on-the-rails-2/](https://hcry.org/christmas-on-the-
 rails-2/)\n\nI'm a transit enthusiast and this is one of my absolute favor
 ite places to visit and take friends to\n\n🎅 Christmas on the Rails bri
 ngs together holiday magic and Toronto-area transit history. The museum's 
 vintage streetcars\, buildings and grounds are decorated for the season\, 
 with Christmas carols and the chance to ride historic streetcars through t
 he winter scenery. Santa may even make an appearance!\n\n🚋 What we'll e
 xperience\n\n* Ride historic streetcars and explore this fascinating trans
 portation museum.\n* Enjoy the festive Christmas decorations and seasonal 
 atmosphere.\n* Spend a few hours discovering the museum and enjoying the r
 ides.\n* Warm up with some holiday treats if you wish (food and drinks at 
 the museum are extra).\n* Finish the outing with a meal and social time at
  Chuck’s Roadhouse before heading back to Toronto.\n\n🎥 Want a previe
 w? Check out this video before you join us:\n\n[https://youtu.be/Gx0ZR2JqC
 1E?si=PnJaA_ydnWdtMmnw](https://youtu.be/Gx0ZR2JqC1E?si=PnJaA_ydnWdtMmnw)\
 n\n📅 Event Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, December 5\, 2026\nDeparture: 11
 :30 AM from Toronto by Christie Station Destination: Halton County Radial 
 Railway Museum\, Milton\nTransportation: Rental SUV or minivan\nAfter the 
 museum: Chuck’s Roadhouse for dinner\nReturn: Toronto after late lunch\;
  exact return time will depend on the evening's schedule and traffic. Will
  be back at Christie Station around 6PM\n\n💰 Cost: $85 per person\n\nYo
 ur $85 covers:\n\n* Round-trip transportation from Toronto in a rental SUV
  or minivan.\n* Admission to Christmas on the Rails at the museum.\n\nDinn
 er\, drinks and any additional purchases are at your own expense. At Chuck
 ’s Roadhouse\, everyone is responsible for their own food and beverage c
 osts.\n\n⚠️ IMPORTANT — HOW TO RESERVE YOUR SPOT\n\nYou must send an
  e-transfer of $85 to nicolasbello@yahoo.com to lock in your spot.\n\nPlea
 se don't RSVP expecting a seat to be held without payment. We're renting a
  vehicle\, so space is limited and reservations need to be confirmed in ad
 vance.\n\nCome along for a fun\, festive day of vintage transit\, Christma
 s atmosphere\, good food and great company!\n\nLooking forward to seeing e
 veryone there! 🎄🚋
